# Jieyu Repository Governance

Follow this repository structure when creating or updating files:

- Put product/application code under `src/`; do not place business code in `docs/`.
- Put executable checks and automation scripts under `scripts/`.
- Every doc type has an end rule: [ADR-0051](../../docs/adr/0051-every-doc-type-has-an-end.md). Update a doc in the same change as the code it names.
- Use `docs/adr/` for durable decisions. A changed decision is a new ADR; do not rewrite an accepted decision. See [ADR-0049](../../docs/adr/0049-decisions-not-current-state-inventories.md).
- Use `docs/architecture/` for the one product-shape page and for contracts that `AI_QUICKSTART.md`, a code comment, or a failing check names. Do not add a second current-state inventory.
- Use `docs/execution/plans/` for execution plans that are still the source for unfinished work. Frontmatter `status` is SSoT (`scripts/check-plans-frontmatter.mjs`). Do not add `docs/execution/archive/`. Finished, superseded, and abandoned plans are deleted from the working tree; git history is the record. A `deferred` plan needs `revisit_when:`.
- Use `docs/execution/specs/<feature-slug>/` for per-feature Spec-Driven Development 三件套 (`requirements.md` / `design.md` / `tasks.md`); template at `docs/execution/specs/_template/`. Triggered for medium+ complexity per `copilot-instructions.md` §5.2.1. Delete a spec directory once every task in `tasks.md` is checked; write N/A items as `- [x] 不适用：…`.
- Use `docs/execution/audits/` only for machine exports that scripts read (ndjson / json / txt). Do not add narrative audit reports.
- Use `docs/execution/release-gates/` for go/no-go checklists and runbooks that are still in force. Auto-generated gate markdown goes to `docs/execution/release-gates/release-evidence/`.
- Use `docs/execution/governance/` for living ledgers that checks or current gates still cite.

Behavior rules:

- **Product architecture decisions**（含层模态、录音语义、时间轴与媒体生命周期等）写入 `docs/adr/`。**不要**把 Cursor 编辑器用户目录下的 plan 文件（例如 `~/.cursor/plans`）当作 Jieyu 的唯一或权威规格库。
- Checkable facts follow code and the live check. Product shape is the one page in `docs/architecture/`。Do not recreate `docs/execution/archive/`.
- Keep docs in the correct execution subfolder; avoid flattening into `docs/execution/`.
- When adding/modifying governed docs, run `npm run check:docs-governance`.
- After large doc moves/renames, run `npm run report:docs-link-debt`.
- Before finishing substantial structural changes, run `npm run check:architecture-guard`.
